We don't need ghosts, professor.

551
00:49:03,982 --> 00:49:06,109
The Fat Lady is there.

552
00:49:06,943 --> 00:49:08,945
Watch where you step! Slow down!

553
00:49:09,529 --> 00:49:12,198
I am a Delegate!

554
