He has eyes like the devil.
And a soul as dark as his name.

557
00:49:29,132 --> 00:49:32,135
It's him, director.
The one everyone is talking about.

558
00:49:32,302 --> 00:49:34,763
It's here, somewhere in the castle!

559
00:49:35,013 --> 00:49:37,182
Sirius Black!

560
00:49:37,432 --> 00:49:42,520
Close the castle, Mr. Filch.
Everyone else, to the Great Hall!

561
00:50:10,590 --> 00:50:15,512
I already registered the astronomy tower
and the Iechucería. There is nothing there.

562
00:50:15,679 --> 00:50:18,264
- Thank you.
- There is nothing on the third floor either.

563
00:50:18,473 --> 00:50:20,392
I already checked the dungeons.

564
00:50:20,558 --> 00:50:23,228
There is no sign of Black,
nor anywhere else.

565
00:50:23,478 --> 00:50:25,980
I didn't expect him to stay.

566
00:50:27,190 --> 00:50:29,526
An amazing feat, don't you think?

567
00:50:29,693 --> 00:50:31,986
Entering Hogwarts Castle alone...

568
00:50:32,153 --> 00:50:34,823
- ...completely undetected.
- Pretty amazing, yes.

569
00:50:34,989 --> 00:50:36,991
Any theory as to how it could
have you achieved it?

570
00:50:37,158 --> 00:50:40,036
Many. One as unlikely as the other.

571
00:50:40,286 --> 00:50:41,830
Remember...

572
00:50:41,996 --> 00:50:44,833
...that before starting the year
I was worried...

573
