And also, only respond
to the call of his own.

599
00:53:07,934 --> 00:53:11,312
Thank you, Mr. Malfoy. He spoke again...

600
00:53:11,479 --> 00:53:13,189
...out of order, Miss Granger.

601
00:53:13,356 --> 00:53:15,358
Are you unable to contain yourself...

602
00:53:15,525 --> 00:53:18,862
...or likes to be
an insufferable know-it-all?

603
00:53:19,153 --> 00:53:22,574
- You're a little right.
- Five points less from Gryffindor.

604
00:53:22,782 --> 00:53:27,370
As an antidote to your ignorance, I want
on my desk, early Monday...

605
00:53:27,579 --> 00:53:31,291
...two rolls of parchment
about the werewolf, with emphasis...

606
00:53:31,457 --> 00:53:34,043
- ...on how to recognize it.
- Tomorrow there is quidditch.

607
00:53:35,169 --> 00:53:38,464
So I suggest you have
Be very careful, Mr. Potter.

608
00:53:38,673 --> 00:53:42,719
Losing a limb
It's not an excuse.

609
00:53:42,927 --> 00:53:46,681
Page 394.

610
00:53:48,683 --> 00:53:50,184
In English, "werewolf"...

611
