...«man», and «wolf», which is «wolf».
"Werewolf", werewolf.

613
00:54:01,321 --> 00:54:03,740
There are different ways to become
in werewolf.

614
00:54:03,948 --> 00:54:06,951
With the power to change shape...

615
00:54:07,201 --> 00:54:09,120
...or if you get bitten by a werewolf.

616
00:54:27,931 --> 00:54:31,559
GO, Harry!

617
00:56:31,345 --> 00:56:34,182
<i>Aresto momentum!</i>

618
