Dementors should not enter that area.
Dumbledore was furious.

628
00:57:13,888 --> 00:57:15,973
As soon as he saved you
He told them to leave.

629
00:57:16,140 --> 00:57:19,811
You also need to know one thing.

630
00:57:20,394 --> 00:57:26,692
When you fell, your broom kind of flew
to the whomping willow and...

631
