...well, here it is.

632
00:57:29,946 --> 00:57:32,240
<i>I'm sorry about your broom.</i>

633
00:57:32,740 --> 00:57:35,201
Is there no way to fix it?

634
00:57:35,409 --> 00:57:36,744
No.

635
00:57:36,911 --> 00:57:40,248
Professor, why do they affect me
both the dementors?

636
00:57:40,665 --> 00:57:43,751
I mean, more than anyone.

637
00:57:43,918 --> 00:57:47,130
Dementors are creatures
most vile that there are on Earth.

638
00:57:47,296 --> 00:57:51,551
They feed on all the feelings
good, all the good memories...

639
00:57:52,093 --> 00:57:56,681
...until one is left alone
with the worst experiences.

640
00:57:56,931 --> 00:58:01,102
You're not weak, Harry.

641
00:58:01,269 --> 00:58:05,356
Dementors affect you more
because you have suffered true horrors.

642
00:58:05,565 --> 00:58:08,651
Horrors that your friends
you can hardly imagine.

643
00:58:09,110 --> 00:58:11,445
You have nothing to be ashamed of.

644
00:58:11,612 --> 00:58:15,658
- I'm afraid, professor.
- You'd be a fool if you didn't have it.

645
00:58:15,825 --> 00:58:19,328
I need to know how to combat them.
You can teach me.

646
00:58:19,495 --> 00:58:21,497
He made the train guy leave.

647
00:58:21,706 --> 00:58:23,457
There was only one that night.

648
00:58:23,749 --> 00:58:28,337
- But he made her leave.
- I don't consider myself an expert, Harry...

649
00:58:28,671 --> 00:58:33,634
...but as dementors seem
having developed an interest in you...

650
00:58:33,801 --> 00:58:37,471
...maybe I should teach you,
but after the holidays.

651
00:58:37,638 --> 00:58:39,557
For now, I need to rest.

652
00:59:24,894 --> 00:59:26,896
- Hey, let me go!
- Very clever.

653
00:59:27,063 --> 00:59:29,982
- But not enough.
- We have a better way.

654
00:59:30,149 --> 00:59:32,735
-Hey, I want to get to Hogsmeade!
- We know.

655
00:59:32,902 --> 00:59:34,362
- Don't worry.
- You're coming.

656
00:59:34,528 --> 00:59:37,240
- We will show you a faster way.
- If you shut up.

657
00:59:37,406 --> 00:59:41,035
- Bless him.
- Let me go! Please, friends!

658
00:59:41,619 --> 00:59:44,205
