No. Is it really...?

670
01:00:25,871 --> 01:00:27,290
-Dumbledore.
- In his studio.

671
01:00:27,456 --> 01:00:29,583
- Going around.
- He does it a lot.

672
01:00:29,750 --> 01:00:31,585
- This map shows...
- Everyone.

673
01:00:31,794 --> 01:00:33,796
- Where are they?
- What they do.

674
01:00:33,963 --> 01:00:35,172
- Every minute.
- Every day.

675
01:00:35,339 --> 01:00:38,259
- Incredible! Where did they get it from?
- We stole it from Filch.

676
01:00:38,426 --> 01:00:41,178
- In first year.
-There are seven secret passages...

677
01:00:41,345 --> 01:00:44,015
- ...to leave the castle.
- We recommend this one.

678
01:00:44,181 --> 01:00:47,351
- The one with the one-eyed witch.
- Goes straight to Honeydukes.

679
01:00:47,518 --> 01:00:49,353
But hurry up. Filch is coming here.

680
01:00:49,520 --> 01:00:52,940
And don't forget, when you're done,
Just touch it and say:

681
01:00:53,107 --> 01:00:57,445
"Mischief performed."
If not, anyone can read it.

682
01:01:52,208 --> 01:01:56,295
It is the building with the most ghosts
of Great Britain. Did I mention that already?

683
01:01:56,462 --> 01:01:58,172
Twice.

684
01:01:58,839 --> 01:02:01,175
Do you want to get a little closer?

685
01:02:01,384 --> 01:02:03,094
To the Shrieking Shack?

686
01:02:03,386 --> 01:02:06,263
The truth is, I'm fine here.

687
01:02:06,430 --> 01:02:08,265
Look who's here.

688
01:02:08,682 --> 01:02:10,935
Are you looking for
your new dream home?

689
01:02:11,185 --> 01:02:15,439
It's a little grand for you, isn't it?
Does your family not sleep in a room?

690
01:02:15,689 --> 01:02:18,859
-Shut your mouth, Malfoy.
- You're not very friendly.

691
01:02:19,193 --> 01:02:24,281
Boys, it's time to teach him
"Weasle-Bi" to respect his superiors.

692
01:02:24,490 --> 01:02:27,910
- You're not talking about yourself!
- How dare you talk to me?

693
01:02:28,077 --> 01:02:30,079
Filthy dirty blood!

694
01:02:34,291 --> 01:02:35,835
Who is there?

695
01:02:42,049 --> 01:02:44,427
'Boom!
'That? '

696
01:03:04,238 --> 01:03:06,532
What do you have, Malfoy?
Lost your skis?

697
