Allow me, Mr. Minister.

708
01:03:48,324 --> 01:03:50,159
I'm sorry.

709
01:03:50,367 --> 01:03:53,287
Rosmerta, dear!
I hope business goes well.

710
01:03:53,496 --> 01:03:57,374
It would be much better if the Ministry...

711
