732
01:05:15,160 --> 01:05:17,746
- Yes, he never let James and Sirius out of his sight.
- What happened?

733
01:05:17,913 --> 01:05:20,165
Peter Pettigrew
tried to warn the Potters...

734
01:05:20,332 --> 01:05:24,378
...and he would have made it if he hadn't bumped into each other
with an old friend, Sirius Black.

735
01:05:24,545 --> 01:05:28,382
Black was ruthless.
He didn't just kill Pettigrew.

736
01:05:28,591 --> 01:05:30,759
Destroyed it!

737
01:05:31,385 --> 01:05:36,140
One finger That was all that was left.
One finger! Nothing else.

738
